        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From a Small Shop to a Tech Retail Giant</h2>Start with a modest store and transform it into a true temple of electronics. Expand your assortment, unlock new gadgets, and make sure customers always find what they’re looking for – from smartphones and laptops to the best hardware available on the market.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/259f96031e3635b413197f82199d9e1b.poster.avif?t=1783534228\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/259f96031e3635b413197f82199d9e1b.webm?t=1783534228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/259f96031e3635b413197f82199d9e1b.mp4?t=1783534228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Shelves, Happy Customers</h2>Keep track of stock, order goods, set prices, and follow the latest trends. Create tempting offers by adjusting pricing strategies and make sure customers leave your store with a smile… and with their bags full!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/410c44d0e000f66427b9fc269bbcfef0.poster.avif?t=1783534228\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/410c44d0e000f66427b9fc269bbcfef0.webm?t=1783534228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/410c44d0e000f66427b9fc269bbcfef0.mp4?t=1783534228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Your Business Through Franchising</h2>Your store doesn’t have to remain a single point on the map! Invest in new locations and launch franchises to reach even more customers. Each new store brings fresh opportunities, unique challenges, and the chance to build a true electronics empire.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/4c517baa1e14e4075e83e7dd6b83e477.poster.avif?t=1783534228\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/4c517baa1e14e4075e83e7dd6b83e477.webm?t=1783534228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/4c517baa1e14e4075e83e7dd6b83e477.mp4?t=1783534228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Electronics Store</h2>Feel the spirit of real electronics retail! Expand your store’s offer with increasingly advanced gadgets, observe customer behavior, and adapt to their needs. Create a shopping experience that will attract more and more visitors over time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/f3f158d571037bc6ff2cc5c93c42e414.poster.avif?t=1783534228\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/f3f158d571037bc6ff2cc5c93c42e414.webm?t=1783534228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/f3f158d571037bc6ff2cc5c93c42e414.mp4?t=1783534228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From a Small Shop to a Tech Retail Giant</h2>Start with a modest store and transform it into a true temple of electronics. Expand your assortment, unlock new gadgets, and make sure customers always find what they’re looking for – from smartphones and laptops to the best hardware available on the market.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/259f96031e3635b413197f82199d9e1b.poster.avif?t=1783534228\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/259f96031e3635b413197f82199d9e1b.webm?t=1783534228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/259f96031e3635b413197f82199d9e1b.mp4?t=1783534228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Shelves, Happy Customers</h2>Keep track of stock, order goods, set prices, and follow the latest trends. Create tempting offers by adjusting pricing strategies and make sure customers leave your store with a smile… and with their bags full!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/410c44d0e000f66427b9fc269bbcfef0.poster.avif?t=1783534228\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/410c44d0e000f66427b9fc269bbcfef0.webm?t=1783534228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/410c44d0e000f66427b9fc269bbcfef0.mp4?t=1783534228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Your Business Through Franchising</h2>Your store doesn’t have to remain a single point on the map! Invest in new locations and launch franchises to reach even more customers. Each new store brings fresh opportunities, unique challenges, and the chance to build a true electronics empire.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/4c517baa1e14e4075e83e7dd6b83e477.poster.avif?t=1783534228\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/4c517baa1e14e4075e83e7dd6b83e477.webm?t=1783534228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/4c517baa1e14e4075e83e7dd6b83e477.mp4?t=1783534228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Electronics Store</h2>Feel the spirit of real electronics retail! Expand your store’s offer with increasingly advanced gadgets, observe customer behavior, and adapt to their needs. Create a shopping experience that will attract more and more visitors over time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/f3f158d571037bc6ff2cc5c93c42e414.poster.avif?t=1783534228\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/f3f158d571037bc6ff2cc5c93c42e414.webm?t=1783534228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988670/extras/f3f158d571037bc6ff2cc5c93c42e414.mp4?t=1783534228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
